#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A table of the language features included in OpenQASM 3."
msgstr "Isang talaan ng mga language feature na kasama sa OpenQASM 3."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table"
msgstr "Talaan ng mga feature ng OpenQASM 3"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore negctrl, durationof, vstring */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "OpenQASM 3 feature table {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"
msgstr "Talaan ng mga feature ng OpenQASM 3 {#openqasm-3-feature-table}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Below is a list of the `OpenQASM 3` language features.\n"
msgstr "Nasa ibaba ang listahan ng mga language feature ng `OpenQASM 3`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more details on these capabilities, see the [OpenQASM 3.X Live "
"Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa higit pang detalye tungkol sa mga kakayahang ito, tingnan ang "
"[OpenQASM 3.X Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Susi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Not supported\n"
msgstr "❌ Hindi suportado\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "🟡 Partial support\n"
msgstr "🟡 Bahagyang suportado\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Supported\n"
msgstr "✅ Suportado\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang ibig sabihin ng kumpletong \"suportado\" na marka ay depende sa kolum:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: Ang feature ay maaaring i-parse ng [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (gamit ang `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), ma-represent sa isang [`QuantumCircuit`,](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"
"at ma-export sa OpenQASM 3 gamit ang [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*IBM Qiskit Runtime*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature "
"can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM&reg; Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"*IBM Qiskit Runtime*: Ang isang circuit na naglalaman ng katumbas na Qiskit "
"feature ay matagumpay na maipapatupad sa hardware sa pamamagitan ng IBM&reg;"
" Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang ibig sabihin ng \"bahagyang suportado\" ay karaniwang depende sa mga "
"naka-link na tala.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang pinakakaraniwang paraan ng pagsusumite ng mga circuit sa IBM Qiskit Runtime ay ang paggawa ng circuit sa Python-space interface ng Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Ang mga circuit na ginawa at isinumite sa ganitong paraan ay hindi na kailangang i-load mula sa mga OpenQASM 3 file papunta sa Qiskit SDK.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung hindi mo direktang ginagamit ang OpenQASM 3, ligtas mong magagamit ang mga feature na suportado para sa representasyon sa Qiskit SDK, pag-export sa OpenQASM 3, at pagsusumite sa IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"Kasama rito ang mga feature na hindi ma-load ng Qiskit SDK mula sa OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

